## File 1: src/modules/threshold/threshold.service.ts

Add `findEffectiveForSubjectYear` to `ThresholdService` after `findBySubjectId` (line 278):

```typescript
async findEffectiveForSubjectYear(
  subjectId: number,
  academicYearId: number,
  thresholdType?: ThresholdTypeEnum,
): Promise<Threshold | null> {
  const academicYear = await AcademicYear.getRepository().findOne({
    where: { id: academicYearId },
    select: { year: true },
  });
  const effectiveYear = academicYear?.year
    ? parseInt(academicYear.year.split('/')[0], 10)
    : academicYearId;
  if (Number.isNaN(effectiveYear)) {
    return null;
  }

  const qb = Threshold.createQueryBuilder('threshold')
    .where('threshold.subjectId = :subjectId', { subjectId })
    .andWhere('threshold.effectiveFrom <= :effectiveYear', { effectiveYear })
    .andWhere('threshold.effectiveTo >= :effectiveYear', { effectiveYear })
    .andWhere('threshold.statusType = :statusType', {
      statusType: IThresholdStatusType.ACTIVE,
    });
  if (thresholdType) {
    qb.andWhere('threshold.thresholdType = :thresholdType', {
      thresholdType,
    });
  }
  return qb.orderBy('threshold.createdAt', 'DESC').getOne();
}
```

### Notes
- **No new typeorm imports** — the query-builder API is fully static (`In`, `LessThanOrEqual`, `MoreThanOrEqual` not needed)
- `AcademicYear` already imported (line 28); `ThresholdTypeEnum` imported (line 17); `IThresholdStatusType` imported (line 16)
- Uses static entity patterns (`AcademicYear.getRepository()`, `Threshold.createQueryBuilder`) consistent with the rest of the class — `ThresholdService` has NO DataSource injection
- `ORDER BY createdAt DESC` makes overlapping active-threshold matches deterministic (EC-01 → option B)
- Mirrors the existing `SyllabusService.findEffectiveForSubjectYear` (syllabus.service.ts:499-530): same `year.split('/')[0]` extraction, same NaN → null guard, same fallback to `academicYearId` when no AcademicYear record

